.TH RFID-VOICE-MEMO 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-voice-memo \- record, play, bind, and inspect RFID voice memos
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-voice-memo
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stores short Jabra voice memos keyed by RFID card and can bind a card to record
or play actions through the RFID mode tree.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B record
Record a memo for a card.
.TP
.B play
Play a stored memo for a card.
.TP
.B bind
Create sidecar scripts for record/play actions.
.TP
.B status
Show local memo status.
.TP
.B arm-next
Arm the next distinct card for voice memo behavior.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-record-30s (1),
.BR rfid-voice-memo-arm-next (1)
